							Finger for TOPThis is a really simple version of the Un*x finger command, written for TOPusers. It looks at the specified userid's password entry and gives aformatted report of the gecos fields. It also supports .plan and.project files. See the included man page. README		- this filefinger		- executable compiled for 68000finger.c	- source codefinger.man	- formatted man page. use 'less finger.man' to viewfinger.prf	- proff source for the man page - install in /dd/usr/doc/.manmakefile	- makefile for finger